  "releaseNotes": "## [1.5.1.0] - 2026-06-09\n\n### Fixed\n\n- An issue where a UTF-8 BOM written to the input stream would be interpreted as part of a message. \n  This would cause the first message to be invalid and the first read to never complete. \n  In turn this would cause the SDK to never detect any devices.\n  For applications written for the .NET Framework, the BOM would be written to the stream depending on execution environment.",
